<body>
    <h1>Payment Hold</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"PaymentHold-Summary">Summary</h2>
<p>When processing a mail order prescription there may be an issue with the=
 member=E2=80=99s payment method that blocks processing. This functionality=
 allows the member to update the payment method and send the order to be pr=
ocessed.</p>
<h2 id=3D"PaymentHold-Parameters">Parameters</h2>
<h3 id=3D"PaymentHold-Mailorder">Mail order</h3>
<p>{"status":"\"ELIGIBLE\"","selfServeOption":"\"PAYMENT_HOLD\"","priority"=
:"1","callToAction":"\"N\"","displayValue":"\"Change Payment Method\"","her=
oAction":"\"N\""}</p>
<h2 id=3D"PaymentHold-Filters">Filters</h2>
<h3 id=3D"PaymentHold-Mailorder.1">Mail order</h3>
<p>(fillStatusReasonCode =3D=3D 54)</p>
